Student 1: AMINA The Problem and the Solution
Good day, judges, teachers, and fellow innovators!
Today, millions of students struggle because they lack access to a personal tutor who can explain concepts
simply and patiently.
When studying independently, students often search through dozens of complicated web pages just to find
a single answer. Too often, those online answers can be confusing, misleading, or inaccurate.
While private tutors and high-end AI devices exist, they are often too expensive for many parents and
average schools to afford.
To solve this problem, we created Nova, the Humanoid STEM Teacher Robot.
Nova is safe and educational. It is purpose-built strictly for learning and is designed to answer educational
and academic questions, helping students stay focused on their studies.
Nova is also simple and friendly. It breaks down complex topics step-by-step using clear, encouraging, and
student-friendly language.
Nova provides flexible learning modes. It supports interactive voice and text communication, as well as a
text-only mode for quiet reading and silent classroom study.
Nova is also designed to be affordable and accessible. By using efficient,
low-cost hardware and opensource models, Nova aims to deliver high-tech tutoring at a fraction of the cost of expensive educational
systems.
