Student 2: AFFAN Live Demonstration
Thank you!
Nova is not just a digital screen. It is fully mobile.
Using our wireless control interface, Nova can navigate the classroom and move directly toward different
groups of students.
With our directional control, we can move Nova forward, backward, left, or right, allowing the robot to
interact with students in different areas of the classroom.
Nova also supports different learning modes.
