Student 3:MUJAHEED Future Plans and Continuous Improvement

Thank you!
Although Nova is fully functional today, our mission to improve it is continuous.
Our first goal is to achieve faster voice responses. We are optimizing our audio processing and edge
computing systems to make voice interactions faster and more natural.
Our second goal is to improve academic precision. We plan to continue developing and fine-tuning Nova
with specialized STEM educational datasets so that it can handle more advanced secondary-school and
higher-level problem solving.
We also plan to adopt world-standard AI models and technologies to continuously improve Nova's ability to
support students and keep the learning experience aligned with international educational standards.
Another important area is hardware and sensor development. We plan to introduce autonomous object
tracking, improved battery systems, and additional classroom-assistant features.
These improvements will allow Nova to become more intelligent, more independent, and more useful in
real classroom environments.
Our ultimate goal is to transform Nova from a mobile AI tutor into a complete classroom learning
companion that can help students understand difficult concepts, interact with their environment, and make
quality education more accessible.
